  "body": "Hello team,\n\nI am working on a project that scores public codebases based on agent friendliness. And `black` has scored 84.9 out of 100.\n\n[![Agent Friendly](https://agentfriendlycode.com/api/badge/github/psf/black.svg)](https://agentfriendlycode.com/repo/12653)\n\n--\n\nYou can add the badge in your README to let the world know about it. You just need to copy and paste this snippet 👇\n```\n[![Agent Friendly](https://agentfriendlycode.com/api/badge/github/psf/black.svg)](https://agentfriendlycode.com/repo/12653)\n```\n\n---\nhttps://www.agentfriendlycode.com/repo/12653\n\n<img width=\"1846\" height=\"1160\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00c1178b-3da5-4a43-b49d-f06228f7e4a3\" />",
